# lib/ rules

Generated from AGENTS.md — do not hand-edit. Regenerate with `npx @codeandtheory/sdp generate-rules`.

## actions.ts
- All mutations validated with Zod before any database write.
- `deleteInvoice` (line 121) is an intentional tutorial placeholder — do not implement without a governing spec.
- `revalidatePath` must be called after successful mutations to keep the Next.js cache consistent.

## data.ts
- Read-only database functions only — no mutations here.
- All queries use the `postgres` tagged-template literal (`sql\`...\``) — never string concatenation.
- `POSTGRES_URL` must be set in environment; SSL required (`ssl: 'require'`).

## definitions.ts
- Shared TypeScript types for all data models. Update here when the data schema changes — do not duplicate types in component files.

## Secrets
Never commit `POSTGRES_URL` or `AUTH_SECRET` values. Reference by env var name only.
